                <note rend="inline" type="source">860c.24/51 supp.: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in Poland</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Pearson</hi>)</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1925-06-03T19:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">June 3, 1925—7
                                p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>46. Department’s telegram No. 1, dated January 5, 4 p.m. Discreetly ascertain
                    whether contract for the purchase of arms has been concluded by the Government
                    of Poland.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
